  "steps": [
    "Cook the rice with the water until fluffy and spread it on a plate to cool, mixing in 1 tbsp of the sesame oil.",
    "Dry roast the coriander seeds, fenugreek seeds and one red chilli until aromatic, then grind to a coarse powder.",
    "Heat the remaining oil, crackle the mustard seeds, then fry the chana dal, urad dal, peanuts, remaining chillies and curry leaves until golden.",
    "Add the hing, turmeric and tamarind pulp with the salt and jaggery and cook until the paste thickens and the oil separates.",
    "Stir in the ground spice powder and cook 1 minute.",
    "Fold the paste through the rice gently and rest 15 minutes so the flavours settle."
  ]
